## What is this?

This directory contains the FPF specification split into individual pattern
files for efficient AI-agent consumption. Instead of loading a ~4 MB monolithic
file, agents load only the patterns they need via indexes.

## Structure

```
skills/fpf/
├── SKILL.md                    # Agent navigation hub (start here)
├── README.md                   # This file
├── reference/
│   ├── agent_index_patterns.md # ID → Title → Builds on
│   ├── agent_index_keywords.md # Keyword → Pattern IDs
│   ├── agent_index_queries.md  # Question → Pattern ID
│   ├── intro_*.md              # Preface/intro sections
│   └── fpf-patterns/
│       ├── index.md            # Full pattern table
│       └── A.1.md … G.13.md   # Individual pattern files
└── scripts/
    ├── __init__.py
    ├── _fpf_common.py
    ├── fpf_tools.py
    └── audit_fpf_patterns.py
```

